  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">一款面向<strong>包开发者</strong>的<strong>Minecraft</strong>模组，可通过<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">KubeJS</a>轻松修改战利品表和战利品修饰符。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">对于 1.21+ 版本，该模组仅支持<strong>NeoForge</strong>！<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">1.21 版本的维基请<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.almostreliable.com%252flootjs%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里</a>查看。<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">旧版本用户可使用<a href=\"https://github.com/AlmostReliable/lootjs/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">旧版维基</a>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>链接</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AlmostReliable/lootjs-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub README 页面</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fThFnwZCyYY\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
